+  "limits": "Firm capacity available for new load: contracted grid import, less current site peak, plus any behind-the-meter supply that genuinely counts as firm.",
+  "relation": "Headroom = (contracted MW \u2212 current site peak MW) + \u03a3(BTM capacity \u00d7 firm capacity factor). A battery contributes its firm fraction, not its nameplate.",
